  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><strong style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);color:rgb(39,37,30);\">Join the ThreadVibe Affiliate Team</strong></p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">ThreadVibe Clothing is a fitness-inspired apparel brand built for people who train hard, live with discipline, and want their clothing to reflect that mindset. We create bold, comfortable gym and lifestyle apparel for lifters, athletes, fitness creators, and everyday people who take pride in showing up and putting in the work.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">We’re looking for affiliates and brand partners who genuinely align with the ThreadVibe lifestyle. This program is a great fit for fitness influencers, gym creators, personal trainers, athletes, bodybuilding and CrossFit communities, lifestyle creators, and anyone with an audience that values confidence, consistency, and gym culture.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">As a ThreadVibe affiliate, you can earn commission by sharing your unique referral link or discount code with your audience. You can promote through Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, Facebook, email, blogs, workout videos, gym content, try-on hauls, product reviews, event content, and everyday lifestyle posts.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">What makes ThreadVibe different is our focus on more than just clothing. We’re building a community around confidence, self-expression, and the work it takes to become better. We want partners who create authentic content, represent the brand well, and are excited to grow with us long term.</p><p class=\"my-2 [&amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-width:0px;border-color:rgba(39,26,0,0.14);margin:1rem 0px 0.5rem;color:rgb(39,37,30);font-family:pplxSerif, pplxSerif, 'ui-serif', Georgia, Cambria, 'Hiragino Mincho ProN', 'Yu Mincho', 'Songti SC', SimSun, 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, 'Songti TC', 'MingLiU_HKSCS', 'Songti TC', PMingLiU, AppleMyungjo, Batang, serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\">If your audience is passionate about fitness, lifting, activewear, gym motivation, or lifestyle apparel, we’d love to have you apply and see if ThreadVibe is the right fit. Join us and help bring ThreadVibe to more people who live the lifestyle every day.</p></div></div>",
